@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All Paid Search Cost
GET {{base_url}}/api/paid-search-cost

### Get Paid Search Cost by Date
GET {{base_url}}/api/paid-search-cost/2026-01-15

### Create Paid Search Cost
POST {{base_url}}/api/paid-search-cost
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-01-15",
  "cost": 150.50
}

### Update Paid Search Cost
PUT {{base_url}}/api/paid-search-cost/2026-01-15
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-01-15",
  "cost": 200.75
}

### Delete Paid Search Cost
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/paid-search-cost/2026-01-15